  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Road Summer 2007 was held with Pokémon Festa 2007 \"Pokémon Pal City\" at eight venues, from Fukuoka on 15 July to Osaka on 2 September 2007, with entry on the day. Everyone in a venue's qualifier got its own Pokémon Pal City, Masakazu Fukuda's Stadium with a different pair of Pokémon for each region, seven versions in all. The 384 finalists per division got the cosmos holo Supporter Roseanne's Research, and the top four of each division Miracle Diamond, the summer counterpart of Mysterious Pearl: 96 copies. In the side events, everyone in the Dialga vs. Palkia vs. Darkrai One Day Battle got a Pikachu and winning teams Professor Oak's Visit, while Tag Battle DP gave its pairs Touch Exchange! and Plusle and Minun as excellence awards.",
